{"3630620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legend of Hiraq", "steam_appid": 3630620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an epic quest across a mystical desert to reach the legendary Mount Qaf.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 1001 Nights and rich oriental folklore, this third-person action-adventure game challenges you to scale ancient ruins, solve intricate puzzles, and battle formidable foes—all to save a loved one. Uncover hidden secrets in lost temples and relics as you shape your destiny in a world where every crumbling monument holds a timeless tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.poster.avif?t=1779126989\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.webm?t=1779126989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/4294d7e7445c363e9740c6146229a695.mp4?t=1779126989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A Glimpse of Mount Qaf</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount Qaf isn’t just a place — it’s a feeling. A surreal, tranquil world steeped in mystery, waiting for you to uncover its secrets. Every vista tells a story; every moment invites exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.poster.avif?t=1779126989\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.webm?t=1779126989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/033f20b124d0ec77c9348377c9218395.mp4?t=1779126989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Balance, Bravery &amp; Beyond</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile 3D Platforming:</strong> Traverse dangerous environments and scale colossal architecture. Adventure lives in the physical details—you will need to carefully balance on ledges, execute precise wall-runs, swing across chasms, and navigate crumbling beams to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical, Deliberate Combat:</strong> Face off against mythical enemies in challenging, stamina-driven melee combat. Success requires mastering defensive dodges, reading enemy attack patterns, and striking with precise timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzle Solving:</strong> The ruins of Mount Qaf are locked behind ancient mechanics. You will need to manipulate environmental elements, decode hidden relics, and solve spatial logic puzzles to open new pathways and progress your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.poster.avif?t=1779126989\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.webm?t=1779126989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630620/extras/7e2db3307cac365f3a2ecfa5b5b14069.mp4?t=1779126989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_t